@startuml

actor User

participant Main
participant ReservationCheckThread
participant ConfirmationThread
participant LoadReportThread

User -> Main : start application

Main -> ReservationCheckThread : start()
Main -> ConfirmationThread : start()
Main -> LoadReportThread : start()

activate ReservationCheckThread
activate ConfirmationThread
activate LoadReportThread

ReservationCheckThread -> ReservationCheckThread : check reservations
ConfirmationThread -> ConfirmationThread : prepare confirmations
LoadReportThread -> LoadReportThread : generate load report

ReservationCheckThread --> Main : join()
ConfirmationThread --> Main : join()
LoadReportThread --> Main : join()

deactivate ReservationCheckThread
deactivate ConfirmationThread
deactivate LoadReportThread

Main -> User : print final results

@enduml